	(text "CH: DRIVER AND 6 GATES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.684 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05ac54a3-2e4b-529e-9081-eaa4b6b0f450")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 269.348 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "076d1164-3329-51b2-8cd7-0a7d7f96b93e")
	)
	(text "CH: TURN-OFF BUFFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 451.595 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "08bf4c5d-a84c-574b-b448-74fac79cad67")
	)
	(text "CH: SHORT-CIRCUIT BOOSTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 193.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "17090e7e-4636-5dc5-b961-e100e3b8aaef")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 90.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "21528ee5-94e9-5110-b10d-2c57c6aa588a")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.684 180.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23008f3b-6000-5e1b-9f59-b772257566b7")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 451.595 73.152 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3029cefb-01dd-5def-9f25-a0e161d3472c")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x BYG23T-M3/TR (1300 V each) - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.85 266.204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "452390ff-a22c-540f-a521-4059dfe4362b")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.712 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6430f920-ab28-57ed-ae45-5ef0f166c4d3")
	)
